cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "BanglaWeatherBench: Monsoon-Stratified Evaluation of Zero-Shot Time-Series Foundation Models on Station Observations"
abstract: "A benchmark of daily weather forecasting on tropical-monsoon station observations: 16 tasks and 170,571 rolling-origin windows over 35 Bangladesh Meteorological Department stations, 10 co-located GHCN-Daily stations, 32 European GHCN-Daily stations as a temperate reference, and NASA POWER reanalysis at all 77 station coordinates, with an independent CHIRPS dekadal rainfall task. Eight zero-shot time-series foundation models are scored against ten trained and statistical baselines."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
